SUMMARY:Muv Luv Presents 2026
DESCRIPTION:aNCHOR will host Muv-Luv Presents 2026 on October 22 at 20:00 JST. You will be able to watch it on YouTube. \nThe bradcast will feature the latest information on Muv-Luv series projects like Muv-Luv Girls’ Garden and Muv-Luv: Tactics – Kalidasa at Nightmare\, as well as a look at future developments. There may even be information revealed here for the first time.
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/muv-luv-presents-2026
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Event_Muv-Luv_10-22-26.jpg
END:VEVENT
