SUMMARY:Genshin Impact Version 7.2 "Hour of Rain" Special Program
DESCRIPTION:miHoYo will host the Genshin Impact Version 7.2 “Hour of Rain” Special Program on October 23 at 5:00 a.m. PT / 8:00 a.m. ET. You will be able to watch it on Twitch (English)\, YouTube (English\, Japanese\, Korean)\, and Bilibili (Chinese). \nThis special program will feature the latest information about new game content and developments in Version 7.2\, as well as “drop” some redemption codes and other bonuses.
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/genshin-impact-version-7-2-hour-of-rain-special-program
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Event_Genshin-Impact_10-23-26.jpg
END:VEVENT
