SUMMARY:Gundam Games 40th Anniversary Live Stream
DESCRIPTION:Bandai Namco will host the “Gundam Games 40th Anniversary Live Stream” on October 28 at 20:00 JST. You will be able to watch it on YouTube (English\, Japanese\, Korean\, Traditional Chinese [Hong Kong]\, Traditional Chinese [Taiwan]\, Simplified Chinese). \nThe broadcast will feature the following segments: \nConsole and PC Games Introduction Corner (60 minutes) – Information concerning the Mobile Suit Gundam: Battle Operation series and Gundam Rogue Orbit. (Editor’s Note: The unannounced Mobile Suit Gundam: Battle Operation 3 leaked earlier this month.)Mobile Games Introduction Corner (15 minutes) – Information on Gundam games 40th anniversary campaigns for mobile games like SD Gundam G Generation ETERNAL.Additional Information Corner (15 minutes) – Etcetera.
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/gundam-games-40th-anniversary-live-stream
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Event_Gundam-Games-40th-Live-Steram_10-28-26.jpg
END:VEVENT
