SUMMARY:Hiroki Yasumoto\, Yoko Taro\, and Yosuke Saito Plot to Promote Voice of Cards Again\, Five Years Later Broadcast
DESCRIPTION:Square Enix will host the “Hiroki Yasumoto\, Yoko Taro\, and Yosuke Saito Plot to Promote Voice of Cards Again\, Five Years Later Broadcast” on October 28 at 20:00 JST. You will be able to watch it on YouTube. \nThe broadcast will feature Voice of Cards: The Isle Dragon Roars game master voice actor Hiroki Yasumoto\, creative director Yoko Taro\, and executive producer Yosuke Saito as they look back on the past five years since Voice of Cards launched\, and dive deep into the appeal of the series. \nUsers can submit questions for the Yasumoto\, Taro\, and Saito by posting on Twitter with the hashtag #ヴォイカ5周年.
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/hiroki-yasumoto-yoko-taro-and-yosuke-saito-plot-to-promote-voice-of-cards-again-five-years-later-broadcast
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Event_Voice-of-Cards_10-28-26.jpg
END:VEVENT
